# Retire policy 2026-11-20: production ended 2021; retire dates are road-presence estimates, staggered by colourway.
# Vauxhall Astra Mk7 (Astra K) five-door hatchback, 2015-2021.
#
# 4,370 mm long, 1,809 mm wide, 1,485 mm high, 2,662 mm wheelbase; 1.0-1.6
# petrol and 1.6 diesel. The Opel Astra K is the same car.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Astra#Astra_K_(2015%E2%80%932021)
#
# Colours: Black, Star Silver, Flame Red and Metro Blue are period Vauxhall
# colours.
#
# Weight: 240 in total (silver 80, black 65, red 50, blue 45).
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 125/518 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 2015-2021 with a road tail to about 2029.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vauxhall-astra-mk7.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vauxhall-astra-mk7/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

